{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34819","headline":"酬张芬赦後见寄 · 司空图","name":"酬张芬赦後见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫凤朝衔五色书，阳春忽布网罗除。\n已将心变寒灰後，岂料光生腐草余。\n建水风烟收客泪，杜陵花烛梦郊居。\n劳君故有诗相赠，欲报琼瑶愧不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}